[enu default]
//*******************************************************
Fridge = "Refrigerator";
Goat = "Disciple of Raah";
Goat_01 =
"Greetings. What offerings do you bring?";
Goat_01a = "What do you accept?";
Goat_01b = "I don't have any offerings.";
Goat_01c = "\cD[Open the doors]";
Goat_01a_1 =
"I accept anything of high values. But for today, I'm willing to settle for something tasty.";
Goat_01a_1a = "What? Why that?";
Goat_01a_2 =
"\cDThe refrigerator chuckles softly, its timbre ringing with amusement. \cJIt is the one delight that elevates life to its most vibrant horizons, "
"is it not?\n\n"
"Yesterday, the taste of flesh. The day before that, a tripartite soul. Tomorrow, the crystals of mixolydian refractions.";
Goat_01a_2a = "Yes. I too have eaten my share of oddities on my journey.";
Goat_01a_2a_1 =
"I can tell. Their residue still clings onto you. Some of it have even elevated your state of being. It's for this same reason that I "
"choose to ingest certain substances.\n\n"
"After all, is it not the experience itself that pushes the Self into motion? Only when one rejects this truth do they slowly die. "
"I however, will continue to seek out further experiences.";
Goat_01a_2a_2 = 
"\cDThe voice goes up a few pitches. \cJSpeaking of object that offers intense experiences, there is something of mine that was supposed to be delivered to me a long time ago, but it was lost in transit.\n\n"
"If you can find it again and bring it here, I will compensate you nicely for it.";
Goat_01a_2b = "Crystals of mixolydian refractions?";
Goat_01a_2b_1 = 
"A truly unique blend of audiovisual sensations when tasted. There was a time many of us would partake in its consumption "
"together. Oh, how it opened our minds to the possibilities beyond.";
Goat_01a_2b_1a = "Is that an offering you'd want?";
Goat_01a_2b_2 = 
"No. Right now -- I'm longing for a different kind of edible, one that is beyond even that.\n\n"
"\cDThe refrigerator goes quiet for a few seconds, seemingly pondering its current circumstance.\n"
"\cJYou know, it is a good thing you happened to arrive here. I need a favor, and there will be something nice in it for you as well when you get it done.";
Goat_01a_2c = "Sorry. I can't relate.";
Goat_01a_2c_1 =
"\cDThe voice shifts to a disappointed tone. \cJThat is unfortunate. Not for the obvious lie of your remark, but for the fact that you may not know what you've been really consuming this entire time.";
Goat_01a_2c_1a = "What do you mean by that?";
Goat_01a_2c_2 = "Assist me -- and find out.";
Goat_01b_2 =
"\cDThe refrigerator smiles. \cJYou do, you just don't know it yet.";
Goat_01b_2a = "Stop smiling. You're creeping me out.";
Goat_01b_3 =
"\cDThe grin on the refrigerator stretches even wider than before. With each passing moments it continues to grow further into a freakishly offensive and scarring mental image.\n\n";
Goat_01b_3a = "Stop it! What do you want?!";
Goat_01b_4 =
"Ha-ha-ha-ha! Lighten up! I'm not going to eat you. One knows better than to try and consume something that's akin to a nuclear reactor.\n\n"
"\cDAfter a brief pause. \cJNow, where was I...";
Goat_01c_1 =
"\cDThe doors are tightly shut.";
Goat_01_0a = "Okay. Let's hear it.";
Goat_01_0b = "\cQ(Leave) \cJNo.";
Goat_01_0c = "\cQ(Leave) \cJEnough of this!";
Goat_02 = 
"Call it -- a hunch. I believe we can help each other. You see, I am feeling rather peckish, not for any regular garbage "
"offered to me, but rather something that will truly satiates the senses.\n\n"
"Where you currently stand is bound to attract unsavory guests, I can offer you the means to deal with them. Interested?";
Goat_02_a = "Yes. Go on.";
Goat_03 = 
"Excellent! I need you to bring me the relic of a two-legged animal. Today I yearn to taste the sky, its calls for me grows "
"louder with every seconds.\n\nReturn to me with this artifact intact, and I will exchange to you something of equal value.";
Goat_03a = "\cI[Accept] \cJAlright, where can I find this thing you want?";
Goat_03b = "\cR[Decline] \cJThat is a ridiculous request. I have better things to do."; 
Goat_03c = "\cR[Decline] \cJNo."; 
Goat_04a_01 =
"It belongs in a place that cannot be reached, at least not yet. You see... it must be attracted to you, both you and this event "
"must resonate accordingly in order to find each other.\n\n"
"Take this, and may it aid you in your journey. \cDThe refrigerator places an Energy Trap in front of you.";
Goat_04a_01a = "Can't you at least provide some useful information?";
Goat_04a_01b = "\cQ(Leave) \cJI'll get going now.";
Goat_04a_02 =
"A regretable outcome, but understandable. If you are to change your mind, come back anytime.";
Goat_04x01 = "Have you changed your mind?";
Goat_04x02 =
"Very good! Now, this thing... it belongs in a place that cannot be reached, at least not yet. You see, it must be attracted to you, both you and this event "
"must resonate accordingly in order to find each other.\n\n"
"Take this, and may it aid you in your journey. \cDThe refrigerator places an Energy Trap in front of you.";
Goat_05 =
"Mmmm... The only thing that comes to mind is to seek that which is below.";
Goat_05a = "What about resource? You do want me to make it back alive, don't you?";
Goat_05b = "\cQ(Leave) \cJThat is not helpful at all.";
Goat_05c = "\cQ(Leave) \cDRemain silent.";
Goat_06 =
"Very well.\n\n"
"Eight... Eight... Eight. That is all I have for you.";
Goat_06a = "\cQ(Leave) \cJGot it. I'm off then.";
Goat_06b = "\cQ(Leave) \cJAs expected, more nonsense.";
Goat_06c = "\cQ(Nod and leave)";
Goat_07 = "How goes your search?";
Goat_07a = "\cI[Give chicken] \cJHere it is.";
Goat_07b = "Nothing yet.";
Goat_07a_01 = "Wonderful! This offering pleases me. I will now depart this world, contented. Please accept this as an expression of my gratitude.\n\nOur bargain is finished. Bye.";
Goat_07a_01a = "Wait! I have some questions before you go.";
Goat_07a_01b = "\cQ(Leave) \cJIt has been an honor to serve you.";
Goat_07a_01c = "\cQ(Leave) \cJThanks. Don't come back.";
Goat_07a_01d = "\cQ(Leave) \cDNod.";
Goat_08 =
"\cDThe entity lets out a loud sinister laugh, its reverberation echoing through the empty halls. \cJYes, you wish to know the nature of what you've "
"been consuming all this time.\n\n"
"It isn't what you deliberately choose to consume, but what was taken without a second thought. Digestion of this world and the other one. "
"You've eaten a fair share of it by now. It has already transformed you.";
Goat_08a = "Explain yourself.";
//*******************************************************
Sjinn = "Disciple of Sjinn";
Sjinn_00 = "I apologize. The Palace is currently closed.";
Sjinn_01 = "\cDEyes now open, she looks at you and smiles.\n\n\cJWell met, traveler. Are you here to visit The Palace?";
Sjinn_01a = "Yes, I would like to visit.";
Sjinn_01a2 = "I have the bell with me.";
Sjinn_01b = "What is The Palace?";
Sjinn_01c = "Who are you?";
Sjinn_01d = "\cQ(Leave) \cJNot at the moment.";
Sjinn_01a_1 =
"Oh, it appears you're not carrying a resonating bell. Please return to me upon acquiring one. Visitors must have a bell on them at all times to "
"prevent getting lost.\n\nThank you for your understanding.";
Sjinn_01a_1a = "Where can I find one?";
Sjinn_01a_2 = 
"A resonating bell may be acquired from a few places.\n\n"
"One is given to every pilgrim once they reach the end of the of their initiation trial. Another may be temporarily given for the sake of live "
"demonstration. Private bookings are currently unavailable for the time being. We deeply apologize for the inconvenience.";
Sjinn_01a_2a = "There's something else I want to ask you about.";
Sjinn_01a_3 = "Of course, how may I help?";
Sjinn_01b_1 =
"The Palace is a collaborative project between the disciples of Sjinn and the disciples of Adam. Through their marvelous neurocybernetic "
"advancements and our extensive research into dreams, we are able to provide a profound experience that corresponds to the deepest reality within the user.";
Sjinn_01c_1 =
"I no longer remember who I am in this waking world. I exist only to greet and guide those who seeks entrance into The Palace.";
Sjinn_04 = "Very good. Ring the bell when you are ready, and let us depart together.";
/*

Threshold: Ring the resonating bell.